{"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"By default, the embedded payment element will accept all supported cards by Stripe.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"You can specify card brands the embedded payment element should block disallow or allow payment for by providing an array of those card brands.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Note: For Apple Pay, the list of supported card brands is determined by combining ","type":"text"},{"code":"StripeAPI.supportedPKPaymentNetworks()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with ","type":"text"},{"code":"StripeAPI.additionalEnabledApplePayNetworks","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and then applying the ","type":"text"},{"code":"cardBrandAcceptance","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" filter. This filtered list is then assigned to ","type":"text"},{"code":"PKPaymentRequest.supportedNetworks","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ensuring that only the allowed card brands are available for Apple Pay transactions. Any ","type":"text"},{"code":"PKPaymentNetwork","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" that does not correspond to a ","type":"text"},{"code":"BrandCategory","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" will be blocked if you have specified an allow list, or will not be blocked if you have specified a disallow list.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Note: This is only a client-side solution.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Note: Card brand filtering is not currently supported by Link.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.stripe.stripe-payment-sheet\/documentation\/StripePaymentSheet","doc:\/\/com.stripe.stripe-payment-sheet\/documentation\/StripePaymentSheet\/EmbeddedPaymentElement","doc:\/\/com.stripe.stripe-payment-sheet\/documentation\/StripePaymentSheet\/EmbeddedPaymentElement\/Configuration-swift.struct"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.stripe.stripe-payment-sheet\/documentation\/StripePaymentShee